Files: src/rpi_hwid/artwork/risc-v.svg
Copyright: RISC-V International
License: trademark
 The RISC-V logo (the stacked colour lockup), a registered trademark of
 RISC-V International, drawn only on the label of a board whose processor
 implements the RISC-V ISA, to say so. Copied byte for byte from the
 official logo files on RISC-V International's brand guidelines page,
 https://riscv.org/about/brand-guidelines/, which permit free use for
 non-commercial projects that follow the guidelines (official files only,
 never recreated); see src/rpi_hwid/artwork/README.md.

